<item><title>Tanzania splits foreign affairs ministry into two</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-splits-foreign-affairs-ministry-into-two-c1bb28/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-splits-foreign-affairs-ministry-into-two-c1bb28/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>President Samia Suluhu Hassan appointed Angellah Kairuki to lead East African Cooperation and kept Mahmoud Thabit Kombo in charge of foreign affairs.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:03:09 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" length="33199" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
