<item><title>Tanzania secures US$85 million for maternal and newborn care</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-secures-us-85-million-for-maternal-and-newborn-care-c0e512/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-secures-us-85-million-for-maternal-and-newborn-care-c0e512/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>The five-year Beginnings Fund partnership will support 210 mainland facilities and allocate US$9.6 million to Zanzibar.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:25:06 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" length="33199" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tanzania signs €175 million French loans for water, food and dairy</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-signs-175-million-french-loans-for-water-food-and-f2fc74/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-signs-175-million-french-loans-for-water-food-and-f2fc74/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>The agreements allocate €90 million to Lake Victoria water and sanitation, €55 million to food infrastructure and €30 million to smallholder dairy.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:08:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-signs-175-million-french-loans-for-water-food-and-f2fc74/share.jpg" length="43139" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-signs-175-million-french-loans-for-water-food-and-f2fc74/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
